sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Physician
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant AUTH as Authentication Service
    participant AS as Assessment Service
    participant VP as Validation Pipeline
    participant IE as Inference Engine (EfficientNet-B0)
    participant RS as Report Service
    participant DB as Database

    P->>UI: Enter username and password
    UI->>AUTH: Authenticate user
    activate AUTH
    AUTH->>DB: Find account and verify password
    DB-->>AUTH: Return user record and status
    AUTH-->>UI: Token (or refusal)
    deactivate AUTH

    alt Login failed (wrong credentials, pending, rejected or suspended)
        UI-->>P: Display reason sign-in was refused
    else Login successful
        opt Temporary password
            UI-->>P: Require password change
            P->>UI: Enter new password
            UI->>AUTH: Change password
            AUTH->>DB: Store new password hash
        end
        UI-->>P: Display worklist

        P->>UI: Enter study details and select fundus image
        UI-->>P: Show browser pre-checks
        P->>UI: Proceed to validation
        UI->>AS: Create assessment and upload image
        activate AS
        AS->>DB: Save assessment and image (SHA-256)
        AS->>VP: Validate image
        activate VP
        VP->>VP: Gate 1 file integrity and safe decode
        VP->>VP: Gate 2 retinal-image relevance
        VP->>VP: Gate 3 sharpness, illumination, contrast
        VP-->>AS: Gate results
        deactivate VP
        AS->>DB: Save validation result

        alt Any gate failed (fail-closed)
            AS->>DB: Set status rejected and log audit event
            AS-->>UI: Rejection reason and guidance
            UI-->>P: Display rejection, no model output
        else All gates passed
            AS->>IE: Predict(image, laterality)
            activate IE
            alt Checkpoint or calibration artifact cannot be loaded or verified
                IE-->>AS: ModelCheckpointError, no prediction
                AS-->>UI: 503 Inference engine unavailable, no result saved
                UI-->>P: Display error, no model output
            else Verified checkpoint and calibration artifact loaded
                IE->>IE: Preprocess to 224x224 and compute logits
                IE->>IE: Temperature-scale logits (T = 1.0939)
                IE->>IE: Generate Grad-CAM in the image's shape
                IE-->>AS: Class probabilities, grade, Grad-CAM
                deactivate IE
                AS->>DB: Save model execution, result, Grad-CAM and audit event
                AS-->>UI: Status result_ready
                deactivate AS
                UI-->>P: Display probabilities and Grad-CAM

                P->>UI: Submit professional review
                UI->>AS: Submit review
                activate AS
                alt Disagree or inconclusive without justification
                    AS-->>UI: Validation error
                    UI-->>P: Ask for justification notes
                else Valid review
                    AS->>DB: Save signed, immutable review
                    AS->>DB: Set status completed and log audit event
                    AS-->>UI: Completed, write-locked record
                    UI-->>P: Display completed record
                end
                deactivate AS

                P->>UI: Download report
                UI->>RS: Generate PDF report
                activate RS
                RS->>DB: Read assessment, result and review
                DB-->>RS: Return record
                RS-->>UI: PDF report
                deactivate RS
                UI-->>P: Save hash-anchored PDF
            end
        end
    end
